msgstr "El evento ha sido eliminado."

#: includes/Publishing/ReviewConfirm.php:326
msgid "Artwork removed"
msgstr "Obra eliminada"

#: includes/Publishing/ReviewConfirm.php:326
msgid "Your artwork has been removed from the gallery."
msgstr "Tu obra ha sido eliminada de la galería."

#: includes/Publishing/ReviewConfirm.php:327
msgid ""
"This link may have already been used or may have expired. Please log in to "
"manage your submissions."
msgstr ""
"Es posible que este enlace ya se haya usado o haya caducado. Inicia sesión "
"para gestionar tus envíos."

#: includes/Publishing/ReviewConfirm.php:433
msgid ""
"Title and full text cannot be empty. Fill them back in, or use \"Discard\" "
"from the original email instead."
msgstr ""
"El título y el texto completo no pueden estar vacíos. Rellénalos de nuevo o "
"usa «Descartar» desde el correo original."

#: includes/Publishing/ReviewConfirm.php:434
msgid ""
"The full text cannot be empty. Fill it back in, or use \"Discard\" from the "
"original email instead."
msgstr ""
"El texto completo no puede estar vacío. Rellénalo de nuevo o usa «Descartar» "
"desde el correo original."

#: includes/Publishing/ReviewConfirm.php:853
msgid "Account-wide setting"
msgstr "Configuración general de la cuenta"

#: includes/Publishing/ReviewConfirm.php:856
msgid ""
"Turn off search engine and Fediverse discovery indexing — applies to my "
"whole profile and everything I publish here, not just this piece."
msgstr ""
"Desactivar la indexación de motores de búsqueda y servicios de "
"descubrimiento del Fediverse: se aplica a todo mi perfil y a todo lo que "
"publique aquí, no solo a esta pieza."

#: includes/Publishing/ReviewConfirm.php:879
msgid "Allow visitors and the Fediverse to reply to this artwork."
msgstr ""
"Permitir que los visitantes y el Fediverse respondan a esta obra de arte."

#: includes/Publishing/ReviewConfirm.php:913
