#: blocks/follow-overlay/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Follow Overlay"
msgstr "Superposición de seguir"

#: blocks/follow-overlay/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Trigger next to the reply button that opens a popover explaining the "
"Fediverse/ActivityPub, showing this artwork's artist's copyable @handle, and "
"a remote-follow form that redirects a visitor to their own instance's "
"authorize_interaction screen. Renders nothing off an agnosis_artwork post, "
"or when its author no longer resolves to a real artist actor."
msgstr ""
"Activar junto al botón de respuesta que abre un popover explicando el "
"Fediverse/ActivityPub, mostrando el @handle copiable del artista de esta "
"obra, y un formulario de seguimiento remoto que redirige a un visitante a la "
"pantalla de autorizar_interacción de su propia instancia. No renderiza nada "
"de una publicación agnosis_artwork, o cuando su autor ya no se resuelve a un "
"actor artista real."

